  For example, given a FieldMask "foo.bar,foo.baz,bar.baz",
  the FieldMaskTree will be:
      [_root] -+- foo -+- bar
            |       |
            |       +- baz
            |
            +- bar --- baz
  In the tree, each leaf node represents a field path.
